        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Czesław Miłosz, Bhabananda Deka\n- Roles: poet, prose writer, translator, diplomat, economist, author\n- Places: Poland, Assam, India\n- Topics: literature, economics\n\nFacts:\n- Czesław Miłosz was born on 30 June 1911 and died on 14 August 2004.\n- Czesław Miłosz was a Polish poet, prose writer, translator, and diplomat.\n- Bhabananda Deka was born on 19 August 1929 and died on 4 December 2006.\n- Bhabananda Deka was acknowledged as a pioneer Assamese economist and author.\n- Bhabananda Deka conducted path-breaking early research on the economy of the far eastern part of India.",
